{"ref":"BDB, פָּסַח","hw":"פָּסַח","html":"† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">פָּסַח</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. pass</strong> or <strong>spring over</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:27\" href=\"/Exodus.12.27\">Ex 12:27</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וּפ׳</span> consec. v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:23\" href=\"/Exodus.12.23\">23</a> (J); 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּפָסַחְתִּ֫י</span> v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:13\" href=\"/Exodus.12.13\">13</a> (P), all c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span>, of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>passing over</em> (sparing) houses of Isr.; Inf. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּסוֹחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 31:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.31.5\">Is 31:5</a> <em>a passing over</em> (sc. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל־יְרוּשָׁלַםִ</span>).","next":"BDB, פֶּ֫סַח","prev":"BDB, פִּסָּה"}